      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is an unusual case, of an adult man who was hospitalized with a severe asthmatic attack and severe hypercapnia, refractory to intensive medical treatment, which responded to pressure mechanical ventilation. We advise to consider this mode of treatment in similar cases."},
